arxiv-2412-09004.description:
A 2024 arXiv research paper by Na Xiang, Jingtao Shi. Abstract:
This paper is concerned with a three-level multi-leader-follower incentive Stackelberg game with
H_{\infty}
constraint. Based on
H_{2}/H_{\infty}
control theory, we firstly obtain the worst-case disturbance and the team-optimal strategy by dealing with a nonzero-sum stochastic differential game. The main objective is to establish an incentive Stackelberg strategy set of the three-level hierarchy in which the whole system achieves the top leader’s team-optimal solution and attenuates the external disturbance under
H_{\infty}
constraint.
